[George’s ‘All Alone’]

1025
01:01:41.385 --> 01:01:43.804
♪ Look up to the sky ♪

1026
01:01:44.972 --> 01:01:49.059
♪ Shining alone on a night when the lights are off ♪

1027
01:01:49.143 --> 01:01:51.395
♪ Lonely star ♪

1028
01:01:53.313 --> 01:01:56.400
♪ It somehow resembles me ♪

1029
01:01:56.483 --> 01:02:00.738
♪ My many earnest wishes ♪

1030
01:02:00.821 --> 01:02:04.032
♪ Where did it go ♪

1031
01:02:05.033 --> 01:02:08.704
♪ Why is happiness so special to me... ♪

1032
01:02:08.787 --> 01:02:10.956
{\an8}[Mansik] Oh, I heard dog poop is also used in medicine.

1033
01:02:11.039 --> 01:02:12.791
{\an8}Ah, why are you like this, so gross?

1034
01:02:12.875 --> 01:02:15.794
{\an8}[Seokchun] That bastard police officer
How can you just leave it alone?

1035
01:02:15.878 --> 01:02:16.754
{\an8}Where are the remaining raw materials?

1036
01:02:16.837 --> 01:02:19.840
{\an8}[Jonghyun] Because of customs clearance procedures
I just heard that it would be late.

1037
01:02:20.507 --> 01:02:21.884
{\an8}[Chief] This case is a little different.

1038
01:02:22.760 --> 01:02:23.719
{\an8}A little bit, right?

1039
01:02:23.802 --> 01:02:26.054
{\an8}- [Jonghyun] If poisonous ants appeared
- [Hannah] It’s an opportunity for us.

1040
01:02:26.138 --> 01:02:28.056
{\an8}[Jonghyun] I’ll let you sleep at my house.

1041
01:02:28.640 --> 01:02:31.602
{\an8}[Hannah] Breathing, trembling, wind

1042
01:02:32.936 --> 01:02:34.313
{\an8}I calculate everything, but

1043
01:02:35.522 --> 01:02:36.648
{\an8}[Jooyoung] Let’s begin

1044
01:02:36.732 --> 01:02:37.858
{\an8}[Dongju] There are days like that.

1045
01:02:43.363 --> 01:02:44.698
{\an8}A day like a misfired bullet

1046
01:02:51.121 --> 01:02:53.415
[Heo Seong-jin’s ‘Finish Line’]

